  "source_changes": [
    "Source-selected F64 matrix products extend the maintained current typed-loan route. Product compatibility geometry is shared with the ordinary resident kernel; Cranelift emits all arithmetic using shared native scalar instructions.",
    "Independent output-column F64x2 lanes and odd scalar tails preserve each cell\u2019s +0 identity, exact k order and separate multiplication/addition. No horizontal reduction, reassociation, fused arithmetic or per-term Rust dispatch.",
