    "Complete original binding, planning, staging, clone and constructor budgets remain, with additional conservative product-term work and full ordinary compute/comparison replay. Input NaNs retain the ordinary payload route; generated NaNs/infinities, overflow, signed zeros and cancellation match ordinary bits.",
    "IR385/work152/ABI44 independently rederive selected operation kinds on restore. No pointers, values or permission are serialized. Frozen scalar prefix,144byte root frame and both unsigned Huffman work equations remain.",
    "No ports, C source/flags/binaries, inputs, tolerances, benchmark limits, split, objective or timing boundaries changed."
